  "details": "- CVE-2026-19666: clear the NOQNAME proof alias on the DNS64 filter64 path in\n  query_find(), so query_addnoqnameproof() no longer dereferences the rdataset\n  that query_filter64() has already returned to the message rdataset pool\n- CVE-2026-19667: reject negative cache records that do not fit in a\n  dns_rdata_t; copy_rdataset()/addoptout() now bound the assembled record by\n  DNS_RDATA_MAXLENGTH instead of letting a 64 KiB record reach\n  dns_rdataslab_fromrdataset(), where it trips INSIST(length <= 0xffff) and\n  aborts named\n- CVE-2026-80274: record the denial type (NSEC or NSEC3) next to the NOQNAME\n  proof owner so isc__rdatalist_getnoqname() returns the same denial record\n  isc__rdatalist_addnoqname() selected, instead of the first one in wire order",
